      <p class="page-intro">
        I’ve had the privilege of working across complex service, product, and operational ecosystems. Here are the projects I’m most proud of.
      </p>

      <div class="project-list project-library-list">
        <a class="project-row" href="/projects/enterprise-journey-management-practice">
          <span class="project-name">Enterprise Journey Management</span>
          <span class="project-tags"><span>UX Research</span><span>Service Design</span><span>Strategy</span></span>
        </a>
        <a class="project-row" href="/projects/usps-mail-kiosks-bid-discovery">
